## Proposed Fix for Proxy (P0)

### Fix the `convertedMessages` in v7/v8 to preserve tool call structure

The Azure Responses API supports function calls natively. Instead of flattening tool calls to text, convert them to Azure's format:

```diff
- // BROKEN: flattens tool calls to plain text
- const convertedMessages = messages.map(msg => {
-   if (msg.tool_calls && Array.isArray(msg.tool_calls)) {
-     const toolCallsText = msg.tool_calls.map(tc =>
-       `Called function ${tc.function.name} with arguments: ${tc.function.arguments}`
-     ).join('\n');
-     return { role: msg.role, content: msg.content ? ... };
-   }
-   if (msg.role === 'tool') {
-     return { role: 'user', content: ... };
-   }
- });

+ // FIXED: preserve tool calls in Azure Responses API format
+ const convertedInput = [];
+ for (const msg of messages) {
+   if (msg.role === 'system') {
+     // System messages go in the 'instructions' field or as system items
+     convertedInput.push({ role: 'system', content: msg.content });
+   } else if (msg.role === 'assistant' && msg.tool_calls) {
+     // Assistant text (if any)
+     if (msg.content) {
+       convertedInput.push({ type: 'message', role: 'assistant',
+         content: [{ type: 'output_text', text: msg.content }] });
+     }
+     // Each tool call becomes a function_call item
+     for (const tc of msg.tool_calls) {
+       convertedInput.push({
+         type: 'function_call',
+         call_id: tc.id,
+         name: tc.function.name,
+         arguments: tc.function.arguments
+       });
+     }
+   } else if (msg.role === 'tool') {
+     // Tool results become function_call_output items
+     convertedInput.push({
+       type: 'function_call_output',
+       call_id: msg.tool_call_id,
+       output: msg.content
+     });
+   } else {
+     convertedInput.push({
+       role: msg.role,
+       content: typeof msg.content === 'string'
+         ? msg.content
+         : JSON.stringify(msg.content || '')
+     });
+   }
+ }
```

### Fix for streaming direction (Proxy Bug C)

Ensure the first tool call chunk includes `role: 'assistant'`:

```diff
  if (ev.type === 'response.output_item.added' && ev.item?.type === 'function_call') {
    const callId = ev.item.id || `call_${Date.now()}_${currentToolCallIndex}`;
    const funcName = ev.item.name || '';
    toolCallsBuffer[callId] = { ... };
    res.write(`data: ${JSON.stringify({
      ...,
      choices: [{ index: 0, delta: {
+       role: 'assistant',
        tool_calls: [{ index: currentToolCallIndex, id: callId, ... }]
      }, finish_reason: null }]
    })}\n\n`);
```

